window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-011-82f991ba28861fd4.json"]={sha256:"82f991ba28861fd48887e00d73e8c1ae8318e42fdc1c3745939b236fe39e8ad5",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-1d9b1dbbe7e8f944","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc894","title":"RFC 894: A Standard for the Transmission of IP Datagrams over Ethernet Networks","titleEn":"RFC 894: A Standard for the Transmission of IP Datagrams over Ethernet Networks","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-011","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-011","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-012","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2464"],"title":"IPv6 over Ethernet：線速與有效負載效率","titleEn":"IPv6 over Ethernet: wire rate and payload efficiency","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受IP長度與其內部欄位一致，填補僅用於Ethernet最小長度。 交接時須能核對：交付 frame-bytes.csv及兩個正例、一個長度損壞反例。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Require consistent IP fields and use padding only to satisfy the Ethernet minimum. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver frame-bytes.csv with two valid examples and one corrupted-length case.","difference":"建立每層位元組預算，明確把IPv6 payload當分子而非應用payload。","differenceEn":"Build a per-layer byte ledger using IPv6 payload, not application payload, as the numerator.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["乙太資料欄位的填補不屬於IP總長；接收端以IP表頭長度識別有效資料。\n教學基準：max(0,46-28) = 18 B；對照：max(0,46-40) = 6 B。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","IPv6封包長度與Ethernet線上佔用量不同；前導碼及幀間距須按觀測邊界另列。\n教學基準：(1500-40)/(1500+14+4+8+12)*100 = 94.9284785436 %；對照：(9000-40)/(9000+14+4+8+12)*100 = 99.1369772073 %。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ethernet padding is outside the IP total length; the receiver uses the IP length to identify valid bytes.\nTeaching baseline: max(0,46-28) = 18 B; comparison: max(0,46-40) = 6 B. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","IPv6 packet size differs from Ethernet wire occupancy; account for preamble and interframe gap at the chosen boundary.\nTeaching baseline: (1500-40)/(1500+14+4+8+12)*100 = 94.9284785436 %; comparison: (9000-40)/(9000+14+4+8+12)*100 = 99.1369772073 %. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-021","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4271"],"title":"BGP-4：屬性政策與路由候選篩選","titleEn":"BGP-4: attribute policy and candidate filtering","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受IP長度與其內部欄位一致，填補僅用於Ethernet最小長度。 交接時須能核對：交付 frame-bytes.csv及兩個正例、一個長度損壞反例。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Require consistent IP fields and use padding only to satisfy the Ethernet minimum. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver frame-bytes.csv with two valid examples and one corrupted-length case.","difference":"建立prefix、NEXT_HOP、LOCAL_PREF、AS_PATH與拒絕原因欄，先篩選再在合格路由內選擇。","differenceEn":"Record prefix, NEXT_HOP, LOCAL_PREF, AS_PATH and rejection reason; filter before selecting among eligible routes.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["乙太資料欄位的填補不屬於IP總長；接收端以IP表頭長度識別有效資料。\n教學基準：max(0,46-28) = 18 B；對照：max(0,46-40) = 6 B。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","BGP選路先受本地政策與可達性約束；AS_PATH較短不必然勝出。\n教學基準：(200-160)/200*100 = 20 %；對照：(200-190)/200*100 = 5 %。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Ethernet padding is outside the IP total length; the receiver uses the IP length to identify valid bytes.\nTeaching baseline: max(0,46-28) = 18 B; comparison: max(0,46-40) = 6 B. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","BGP selection is constrained by local policy and reachability; a shorter AS_PATH need not win.\nTeaching baseline: (200-160)/200*100 = 20 %; comparison: (200-190)/200*100 = 5 %. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-bd508114a747c9f2","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2464","title":"RFC 2464: Transmission of IPv6 Packets over Ethernet Networks","titleEn":"RFC 2464: Transmission of IPv6 Packets over Ethernet Networks","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-9aab2974d544c213","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4271","title":"RFC 4271: A Border Gateway Protocol 4 (BGP-4)","titleEn":"RFC 4271: A Border Gateway Protocol 4 (BGP-4)","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
